# ============================================================
#  agent-dual-machine .gitignore
#  原则：运行时状态、隐私数据、本地备份一律不进版本库
#  2026-10-22 首次创建
# ============================================================

# --- 绝对不提交：群成员/聊天记录（含真实 QQ 号、昵称、别名）---
bridge/.relations.json
bridge/.relations.json.*
bridge/.state.json
bridge/.state.json.*
bridge-test/.relations.json
bridge-test/.relations.json.*
bridge-test/.state.json
bridge-test/.state.json.*

# --- 进程锁（运行时生成）---
.bridge.pid
bridge/.bridge.pid
bridge-test/.bridge.pid

# --- 任务轨迹：含外部搜索结果、抓取正文、完整问答 ---
btask/traces/
btask/*.jsonl

# --- 本地备份（配置 / 代码回滚用）---
*.bak
*.bak-*
config.json.*.bak
*.backup
*.orig
*.tmp

# --- 环境变量（含真实密钥，绝不提交）---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- 线上真实配置（含真实群号等标识符）---
# 仓库里只放 bridge/config.example.json，clone 后复制一份再改
bridge/config.json
bridge-test/config.json

# --- 测试双轨目录：同一份代码的第二个副本 ---
# 用 git worktree add ../bridge-test -b test 或 cp -a bridge bridge-test 生成，不入库
bridge-test/

# --- 依赖与日志 ---
node_modules/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# --- 编辑器 / 系统 ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~

# ============================================================
#  注意：releases/ 是发布快照（仅 4 个 .mjs，无配置无隐私），
#  体积可忽略（约 80K/份），保留以便回滚追溯，故不排除。
# ============================================================
